.TH SIGMA-PKG 8 "March 2026" "SigmaOS 1.0" "SigmaOS System Manager's Manual"
.SH NAME
sigma-pkg \- Sovereign Content-Addressed Package Manager for SigmaOS
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sigma-pkg
<\fICOMMAND\fR> [\fIOPTIONS\fR] [\fIPACKAGE\fR...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B sigma-pkg
is the native package management tool for SigmaOS. It handles declarative package installations, content-addressed CAS store queries, transaction rollbacks, multi-distro package conversions (.deb, .rpm, .pkg.tar.zst, .apk), and Signstar PQC signature verifications.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B install \fIPACKAGE\fR...
Install one or more packages transactionally.
.TP
.B remove \fIPACKAGE\fR...
Remove specified packages and purge unneeded orphaned dependencies.
.TP
.B search \fIQUERY\fR
Search local and remote repository metadata for matching packages.
.TP
.B rollback \fICHECKPOINT_ID\fR
Perform atomic sub-second rollback to a previous transaction checkpoint.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sigma-sh (1)
